# Spatial Scene Definition / source-derived review snapshot. 24 hung units (speaker + camera + light
# in one box) over a 28 x 25 m room, plus four monitor faces: the densest example here, and the one
# that carries orientation. Every unit aims straight down, written as Pitch 180 about local +Z --
# the device axis this app draws (README, "Scene objects"). [EVIDENCE] OrientationStatus says how
# far each direction is to be trusted.
# The [SPEAKER] rows were added for this example from the working rule stated in [UNRESOLVED]
# c-audio-channels (logical ch n = SPK_(100+n)); the patch itself is not confirmed.
# Unknown placement is kept in INVENTORY, never silently placed at the origin.
# EVIDENCE is essential when using these room studies (profile SSD_REVIEW_0.1).

